STILL RECORDING, tape 5: "Screen 2" (2026). Halloway Archive. Original story, pictures, sound and music. A work of fiction.

Pictures: drawn in code (canvas 2D) with the tape kit (channel/brand/tapekit.js): a 2.5D renderer, CCTV grading and VHS damage.
Fonts: VT323 (The VT323 Project Authors), SIL Open Font License 1.1. Special Elite (Astigmatic), Apache License 2.0.
Voice: ElevenLabs text-to-speech, model eleven_v4. The cinema announcements: "HA Mall PA" (ElevenLabs Voice Design, made for this series).
Sound effects: generated with ElevenLabs Sound Effects (prompts in sfx/prompts.json).
Music: none. A low drone made from the projector's own hum (tools/score.py).
Sound: every sound is in the scene and is heard through CAM 11 or CAM 12 (tools/mix.py: the rooms, each camera's automatic level control and overload, the tape). The PA chime is from tape 1.
